        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_215ec357a2204133befa2fad82021264",
      "statement": "ScoringQueue relies on the executor's default abort rejection policy: when execute() throws TaskRejectedException because the bounded queue is full, ScoringQueue removes the article id from its in-flight set so the next sweep run can resubmit it, instead of leaving it permanently marked in-flight.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/org/bartram/myfeeder/service/ScoringQueue.java#L52-L72",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:de729a69c86852371b9328141c76e0e8d4b991f07623f199fbc7e57c7bc2e821:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ef2c1e58331c4b8e8a99e63cf98a41ae",
      "statement": "TypeSafeConfig defines the TypeSafeClient bean itself so the starter's @ConditionalOnMissingBean backs off, because the starter's own auto-configured bean would assert api-key has text and crash startup on a blank key; the app-owned bean instead logs a fixed 'TypeSafe Jev not configured; interest scoring disabled' message and leaves the app running.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/org/bartram/myfeeder/config/TypeSafeConfig.java#L23-L48",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b46d6e675f7853ae8957f068081841f0385834ae5edb9d4f93bf0fea780734ca:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_9649ebbdc80a4bec9b1e4d902e522768",
      "statement": "The TypeSafe API key is passed to the SDK only via a Supplier (not the String overload, which requires non-blank text at build time) so it is never logged, not even its length or prefix; baseUrl is set explicitly so the SDK never reads its own TYPESAFE_* environment variables.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/org/bartram/myfeeder/config/TypeSafeConfig.java#L43-L61",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1df96af2ef284f64c92c13fb281d6c728ad25754ab12e714b97c43ebaadd9360:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_3cb9325071a142ef94b725a67f5e217d",
      "statement": "The TypeSafeClient bean uses a Jev-only Reactor Netty request factory (connect timeout 5s, read timeout = spring.ai.typesafe.timeout, default 30s) installed on a clone() of the auto-configured RestClient.Builder, preserving the shared User-Agent customizer without altering the transport used by feed fetches or the Raindrop client; this transport must never be reused elsewhere or rebuilt as a second TypeSafeClient bean.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/org/bartram/myfeeder/config/TypeSafeConfig.java#L30-L34",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2226d9c47a9aa53a0fae7fa6a74fa2d4d7b3f791d10555726c9d147c28af80a8:"
        },
        {
