      "id": "claim_82c196fb94bd4e78bf09cb7c5ab2edf6",
      "statement": "MYFEEDER_TYPESAFE_API_KEY is the required secret binding to spring.ai.typesafe.api-key; it is optional at deploy time, and a blank value disables interest scoring (isConfigured() false, sweep skips runs) without preventing application startup.",
