    {
      "id": "claim_4154a75857d9418fa55bfe17d58b7a02",
      "statement": "Operational throttle levers for Jev load include lowering myfeeder.interest.sweep-batch-size or lengthening sweep-delay in application.yaml for a durable fix, or the emergency kubectl env override `kubectl -n myfeeder set env deploy/myfeeder MYFEEDER_INTEREST_SWEEPBATCHSIZE=20` (which restarts the pod) for immediate mitigation, removed afterward with the trailing-dash kubectl form to avoid Helm's three-way merge keeping a stale override.",
